p7 part two. does 102's p5 hazard have a real instance in this corpus?

bootstrap resamples per rate : 2000
time coordinate              : committed algo_ns samples, resampled
error coordinate             : exact, from p7 part one
cost                         : rate * (time/time_min) + (error/error_min)
                               rate 0 is pure accuracy, large rate pure speed

